sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant SPA as SwiftDrop SPA
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant Google
    participant DB as auth_db

    Customer->>SPA: Click "Continue with Google"
    SPA->>Auth: GET /oauth2/authorization/google
    Auth-->>SPA: Redirect to Google (state + authorization request)
    SPA->>Google: Authenticate and consent
    Google-->>Auth: GET /login/oauth2/code/google?code&state
    Auth->>Google: Exchange authorization code
    Google-->>Auth: Verified profile (subject, email, name)
    Auth->>DB: Find or create/link CUSTOMER + OAuth account
    Auth->>DB: Store SHA-256(one-time login code), expires in 2 minutes
    Auth-->>SPA: Redirect /auth/callback?code=...
    SPA->>Auth: POST /api/v1/auth/token {code}
    Auth->>DB: Lock, validate, and consume code once
    Auth->>DB: Store hashed 7-day refresh token
    Auth-->>SPA: 15-minute RS256 access token + refresh token
